WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Naaba Wobgo e haɓre 1896.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.312
Haa fuɗɗam karnijum 19, Ouagadougou laati laamorgo laamu Moosi.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.024
Laamiiɗo maako, Boukary Koutou, fuɗɗii innde Naaba Wobgo.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.900
E hitaande 1894, o saini alkawal goɗɗum e George Ekem Ferguson, gardiiɗo leydi Britaniya.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.184
Farayse'en ɗon haɓɓa haala nde, ngam ɓe boo ɓe ngiɗi nokkuure nden.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.568
Nder hitaande 1896, kolonne Paul Voulet e Julien Chanoine ɗon yaha lesdi Mossi.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.672
Naaba Wobgo ɗon ɗaɓɓa haɓre, nden gariiri maako ɗon halki.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.912
Voulet jaɓan lesdi Ouagadougou

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.976
Laamiiɗo maɓɓiti nder hitaande 1897, Voulet taƴi mo bandiraawo maako Sighiri.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.900
Naaba Wobgo noddi yimɓe Britiyankooɓe ngam wallugo mo, ammaa ɓe mbaawataa.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:16.216
O dilli haa Gold Coast, to Ghana hannde, o maayi ton nder 1904.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:30.514
Fuuɓe ɗon njaɓɓa feere-feere dow kooɗume, ɓurna fuu dow sahaa gooŋgaaɗum nde o waɗi defte maako e dow ko'e haala mo wurtini. Ɗuum winndannde ina haani wonde.
